From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mio <mio@mio19.uk>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 15:57:13 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 1/1] kernels: shrink ignore lists via unused-subsystem
 auto-drops

Auto-strip Documentation/, tools/, expanded non-ARM arches, and unused
host-side paths (ide/infiniband/ethernet/serio/dvb/nilfs2/udf) so those
files leave the seed excludes. Keep media-device.c and other real vendor
conflicts listed explicitly.
